@startuml Query Products and Units

title 取得商品清單（分頁）／商品明細／單位清單（GET /api/v1/products...，AnyWarehouseRole：三種身分都能查）

actor "總管理者 / 倉庫管理者 / 一般員工" as Caller

box "Ordering.Api" #LightBlue
    participant "ListProductsEndpoint" as Endpoint
end box

box "Ordering.Application" #LightYellow
    participant "ISender" as Sender
    participant "TransactionalDecorator" as Decorator
    participant "ListProductsQueryHandler" as Handler
end box

box "Ordering.Infrastructure" #WhiteSmoke
    participant "IProductReader" as Reader
end box

database "ordering_db" as DB

Caller -> Endpoint : GET /api/v1/products?page=&size=
Endpoint -> Endpoint : RequireAuthorization("AnyWarehouseRole")
Endpoint -> Sender : SendAsync(ListProductsQuery(page, size))
Sender -> Decorator : HandleAsync(request, next, ct)
Decorator -> Decorator : BeginAsync(ct)（純查詢也會經過同一個裝飾器，但沒有東西要 dequeue）
Decorator -> Handler : next()
Handler -> Reader : ListAsync(page, size, ct)
Reader -> DB : select ..., count(*) over() as total_count\nfrom products join product_units ...\noffset ... limit ...
DB --> Reader : rows + total_count
Reader --> Handler : PagedResult<ProductDto>（含解析後的 Unit 名稱）
Handler --> Decorator : Result.Success
Decorator -> Decorator : CommitAsync(ct)
Decorator --> Sender : result
Sender --> Endpoint : result
Endpoint --> Caller : 200 OK { items, totalCount, page, size }

note over Handler, Reader
  GetProduct（單筆明細）、ListProductUnits（單位清單）
  結構相同，差別只在 Reader 查的資料形狀，
  這裡不重複畫。
end note

@enduml
